SOAPBOX: Frustrating. Didn't seem to decode signals as well as hoped.
SOAPBOX: There were highlights though.  ZW5B called me on 80m.
SOAPBOX: Few technical problems.   Digirite (from W5XD) TX signal into
SOAPBOX: a 6700 was badly distorted.  Restart of digirite cured that.
SOAPBOX: Message sequencing didn't always work out.
SOAPBOX: Sometimes, I wished for message function keys,
SOAPBOX: so I could drive the QSO myself.  I called CQ mostly on the odd
SOAPBOX: cycle.  When I would switch to the even cycle, seemed like digirite
SOAPBIX: stopped decoding.  Again, a restart cured that.
SOAPBOX: Few issues to work out before RTTY RU.  I'd regard this as a
SOAPBOX: beta run of an FT4 contest.
SOAPBOX: Remote operation - @K6MTU
SOAPBOX: Tks for the QSOs!
